        <rich_text><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-size: 18pt; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;"><strong>Appendix A - Occupational Health and Safety Checklist</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">The same occupational health and safety standards must be met in the telework location as in the designated workplace. The employee must complete this form by checking all boxes and checking the acknowledgement box to sign the form electronically. The employee must advise the manager of any changes to the telework location that may impact health and safety.</span> </span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Guides:</span></p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li style="font-size: 10pt;"><a href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Documents/Factsheet-Housekeeping-e.pdf?cid&#61;864f46e4-438e-4bd4-8849-cc773abf0d8b" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Housekeeping Guide</span></a></li><li style="font-size: 10pt;"><a href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Documents/Factsheet-Ergonomics-e.pdf?cid&#61;0e23294d-1daa-40c0-b12e-403763383eb1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Ergonomic Guide</span></a></li></ul>
<p><span style="font-size: 10pt;">All fields are mandatory</span></p>]]></rich_text>
